# Hedge Whisperer ruling: "If Hedge Whisperer leaves the battlefield before its activated ability resolves, the target land won't become
# a creature at all" (CR 611.2b): the duration "for as long as this creature remains tapped" never begins. Bot2's Lightning Bolt, paid
# with a Black Lotus, kills the tapped 0/3 Whisperer with its ability on the stack; the evidence (Hero of Bladehold) and the mana
# were already paid, so the Mountain stays an ordinary land.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Hedge Whisperer
Faithless Looting
Mountain
Island
Hero of Bladehold
Llanowar Elves
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hedge Whisperer.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Hero of Bladehold; Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Hedge Whisperer.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain)
Bot1.Choose(Hero of Bladehold)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Hedge Whisperer)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Types = Land
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Power = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard = Hedge Whisperer; Black Lotus; Faithless Looting; Llanowar Elves
Exile = Hero of Bladehold
